WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.437
My Plan shows your own appointments if you are also a resident.

00:00:03.437 --> 00:00:08.162
Manage is where you work for your building. Your actions remain personally accountable.

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:11.131
Start with open tasks in the overview.

00:00:11.131 --> 00:00:16.170
Check incidents and blocks first. The links take you to the relevant area.

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:21.023
Enter the apartment and doorbell name. Email remains optional.

00:00:21.023 --> 00:00:27.897
Create a personal access card. It works once, within seven days. Hand it to the right person.

00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:32.163
Create an additional QR card for another person in the same apartment.

00:00:32.163 --> 00:00:38.664
A recovery code is only for eligible residents without verified email. Check their identity first.

00:00:39.080 --> 00:00:42.400
Building and Equipment shows the resources in your building.

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:47.799
Clear names help people book. Blocking a resource requires an explicit decision.

00:00:48.240 --> 00:00:52.211
The logbook separates new, ongoing and completed cases.

00:00:52.211 --> 00:00:57.923
Open a case and check the resource and history. Personal reports are kept separately.

00:00:58.360 --> 00:01:01.251
After taking a case, record the repair.

00:01:01.251 --> 00:01:06.301
Only a successful function check closes it and releases an incident-related block.

00:01:06.720 --> 00:01:10.122
Recurring appointments are for justified regular use.

00:01:10.122 --> 00:01:15.567
Choose the equipment, time and recurrence. Check the preview before saving the series.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:19.692
Analytics shows usage and available capacity in the building.

00:01:19.692 --> 00:01:23.233
Use it to manage operations, not to rank residents.

00:01:23.640 --> 00:01:27.506
Critical actions show the target and impact before confirmation.

00:01:27.506 --> 00:01:31.279
Cancel if you are unsure. Never share your own password.

00:01:31.720 --> 00:01:34.739
Your administration is limited to your own building.

00:01:34.739 --> 00:01:39.394
Other buildings and global system settings are not house administrator tasks.
